/users/tildedave/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/celery/celery/issues/comments/583073865","html_url":"https://github.com/celery/celery/issues/5919#issuecomment-583073865","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/celery/celery/issues/5919","id":583073865,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDU4MzA3Mzg2NQ==","user":{"login":"frost-nzcr4","id":468395,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2ODM5NQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/468395?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/frost-nzcr4","html_url":"https://github.com/frost-nzcr4","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/frost-nzcr4/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/frost-nzcr4/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/frost-nzcr4/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/frost-nzcr4/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/frost-nzcr4/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/frost-nzcr4/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/frost-nzcr4/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/frost-nzcr4/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/frost-nzcr4/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2020-02-06T19:36:46Z","updated_at":"2020-02-06T19:36:46Z","body":"Hi, the same problem after upgrade to Celery 4+ and Redis 3+.\r\n\r\nMatured Redis library from its next major 3rd release has become more pedantic about socket errors and doesn't reconnects when they are raised and more predictable and fail-proof of messages duplication.\r\nBut Celery still doesn't handles this new Redis behaviour as many people mentions in famous issue andymccurdy/redis-py#1140.\r\n\r\nOn my projects all chords was affected as they under-the-hood are used PubSub that doesn't ensure the connection is alive. I use following workarounds here and there:\r\n* try/except on chord creations,\r\n* ignore_result=True nearly everywhere.\r\n\r\nThe community needs a system level solution to abandon 1000 and 1 ways how to avoid this problem.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/celery/celery/issues/comments/583073865/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"frost-nzcr4","id":468395,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2ODM5NQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/468395?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/frost-nzcr4","html_url":"https://github.com/frost-nzcr4","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/frost-nzcr4/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/frost-nzcr4/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/frost-nzcr4/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/frost-nzcr4/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/frost-nzcr4/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/frost-nzcr4/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/frost-nzcr4/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/frost-nzcr4/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/frost-nzcr4/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"id":3070307185,"node_id":"MDE1OlJlZmVyZW5jZWRFdmVudDMwNzAzMDcxODU=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/celery/celery/issues/events/3070307185","actor":{"login":"michamos","id":2895793,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI4OTU3OTM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2895793?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/michamos","html_url":"https://github.com/michamos","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/michamos/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/michamos/following{/other_user}","gi